    "name": "Don't Stop Looking",
    "steam_appid": 3151880,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, you will control Alex and Jade, a young couple who have recently moved to a new city called Mason Ridge and decided to host a mutual friend for a while. One day, they receive a package intended for the friend, and upon opening it, discover something unexpected that will change their night in ways they never imagined. The couple's survival will depend on <strong>making the right choices.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151880/extras/d68ec29903171b78340a942ba35e8011.poster.avif?t=1747103753\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151880/extras/d68ec29903171b78340a942ba35e8011.webm?t=1747103753\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151880/extras/d68ec29903171b78340a942ba35e8011.mp4?t=1747103753\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is essentially a first-person narrative walking simulator with exploration and dialogue mechanics. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric environment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro PSX/PS1 graphics and VHS film aesthetic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Receive messages from NPCs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character swapping</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151880/extras/e4e01e713ab2d7cead9ea18f062fba4a.poster.avif?t=1747103753\" width=600 height=74 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151880/extras/e4e01e713ab2d7cead9ea18f062fba4a.webm?t=1747103753\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151880/extras/e4e01e713ab2d7cead9ea18f062fba4a.mp4?t=1747103753\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Alex, 22 year old, splits his time between working at a gas station and his passion for photography, capturing special moments at private events. Despite his busy schedule, he made the tough decision to postpone his dream of studying culinary arts. Instead, Alex is dedicated to supporting his partner Jade in achieving her dream of becoming a physical therapist. Together, they are experiencing a new phase in their lives: moving out of their parents' homes and finding a place they can call their own. <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151880/extras/c9d8804a8489dc244b840aedfa4b3655.poster.avif?t=1747103753\" width=600 height=76 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151880/extras/c9d8804a8489dc244b840aedfa4b3655.webm?t=1747103753\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151880/extras/c9d8804a8489dc244b840aedfa4b3655.mp4?t=1747103753\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Jade, 20 years old, is interning at a physical therapy clinic in a neighborhood in Mason Ridge, where she and her partner Alex decided to move to live their relationship more intimately and enjoy moments that were not possible in high school. Despite the internship, Jade spends most of her time at home taking care of household chores and focusing on college, where she is in a lighter period with less calendar pressure.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, you will control Alex and Jade, a young couple who have recently moved to a new city called Mason Ridge and decided to host a mutual friend for a while. One day, they receive a package intended for the friend, and upon opening it, discover something unexpected that will change their night in ways they never imagined. The couple's survival will depend on <strong>making the right choices.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151880/extras/d68ec29903171b78340a942ba35e8011.poster.avif?t=1747103753\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151880/extras/d68ec29903171b78340a942ba35e8011.webm?t=1747103753\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151880/extras/d68ec29903171b78340a942ba35e8011.mp4?t=1747103753\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is essentially a first-person narrative walking simulator with exploration and dialogue mechanics. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric environment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro PSX/PS1 graphics and VHS film aesthetic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Receive messages from NPCs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character swapping</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151880/extras/e4e01e713ab2d7cead9ea18f062fba4a.poster.avif?t=1747103753\" width=600 height=74 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151880/extras/e4e01e713ab2d7cead9ea18f062fba4a.webm?t=1747103753\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151880/extras/e4e01e713ab2d7cead9ea18f062fba4a.mp4?t=1747103753\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Alex, 22 year old, splits his time between working at a gas station and his passion for photography, capturing special moments at private events. Despite his busy schedule, he made the tough decision to postpone his dream of studying culinary arts. Instead, Alex is dedicated to supporting his partner Jade in achieving her dream of becoming a physical therapist. Together, they are experiencing a new phase in their lives: moving out of their parents' homes and finding a place they can call their own. <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151880/extras/c9d8804a8489dc244b840aedfa4b3655.poster.avif?t=1747103753\" width=600 height=76 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151880/extras/c9d8804a8489dc244b840aedfa4b3655.webm?t=1747103753\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151880/extras/c9d8804a8489dc244b840aedfa4b3655.mp4?t=1747103753\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Jade, 20 years old, is interning at a physical therapy clinic in a neighborhood in Mason Ridge, where she and her partner Alex decided to move to live their relationship more intimately and enjoy moments that were not possible in high school. Despite the internship, Jade spends most of her time at home taking care of household chores and focusing on college, where she is in a lighter period with less calendar pressure.</p>",
